# Title: Suspicious File Downloaded From Direct IP Via Certutil.EXE
# ID: 13e6fe51-d478-4c7e-b0f2-6da9b400a829
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-02-15
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of certutil with certain flags that allow the utility to download files from direct IPs.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*urlcache * OR process.command_line:*verifyctl * OR process.command_line:*URL *)) AND ((process.command_line:*://1* OR process.command_line:*://2* OR process.command_line:*://3* OR process.command_line:*://4* OR process.command_line:*://5* OR process.command_line:*://6* OR process.command_line:*://7* OR process.command_line:*://8* OR process.command_line:*://9*)) AND ((process.executable:*\\certutil.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"CertUtil.exe"))) AND NOT ((process.command_line:*://7-*)))
